'''Splatter '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 1]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It resembles the [[Default Knife]] with greyish-white splatters all over it, hence the name. 

== Trivia ==
* The knife used to be an exact replica of the default knife from Clonetrooper1019's ''Murder'', a former Murder Mystery 2 competitor.
* The description of this knife is: "Your everyday Knife"<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/159432647/SKIN-Knife Model of Splatter by CloneTrooper1019]</ref>.
* This knife used to have red blood splatters all over it before a ROBLOX update moderated the texture.

